ARM GAS  /tmp/ccNsDx3o.s 			page 16


 189:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c ****  * BACKLIGHT (BCKL_CTRL / PB8)
 190:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c ****  *
 191:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c ****  * The backlight FET is selected by jumper JP402: in the PMOS position
 192:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c ****  * the pin is ACTIVE LOW (low = backlight on), in the NMOS position it
 193:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c ****  * is active high. Set DISP_BCKL_ACTIVE_LOW accordingly at bring-up.
 194:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c ****  * Current implementation is plain on/off; true dimming needs PWM on
 195:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c ****  * PB8 (TIM10_CH1) — TODO once the UI brightness page is exercised on
 196:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c ****  * hardware.
 197:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c ****  * ========================================================= */
 198:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c **** 
 199:Core/Src/display/ili9341.c **** #define DISP_BCKL_ACTIVE_LOW  (1u)   /* JP402 in PMOS position */
